{"c":[{"id":"a0e555cf4a35a079","sum":"Host UI: NSHostingView with sizingOptions [] reports fittingSize 0 (HostedPanel measures a fresh one). caret-fixture without --background-only takes the foreground in 0.5 s; the host's pid-posted keys reset HIDIdleTime, so idle guards must allow for them.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T194804Z-1b1a9c4f2988a4b0","text":"NSHostingView with sizingOptions [] reports fittingSize 0; HostedPanel measures content on a fresh NSHostingView.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T194804Z-751b516464651e93","text":"caret-fixture launched without --background-only takes the foreground within 0.5 s; the host's pid-posted keys also reset HIDIdleTime, so idle guards must allow for them.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"729d1562d6db48b7","sum":"Empty AppKit text fields report no caret bounds, so KeyType's ghost renderer has no placement and SurfaceCoordinator draws its own ghost. leak-check.ts is quadratic in line length (50 KB NDJSON lines never finish); check one string per line.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T194804Z-8df80214b420ef39","text":"Empty AppKit text fields report no caret bounds, so KeyType's ghost renderer finds no placement; SurfaceCoordinator draws its own ghost at a derived caret.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T201045Z-36d6a210e08a778d","text":"leak-check.ts hashes every word-bounded substring of each line (quadratic in line length): an NDJSON with 50 KB lines never finishes; check one string per line instead.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
